{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-emergence-to-quantum-flat","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:emergence-to-quantum-flat","kind":"proposition","title":"From Tannakian emergence to 2-group quantum flatness","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-self-dual-2group","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-flatness"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-emergence-to-quantum-flat"],"tags":["tannaka-krein","2-group","instanton"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.emergence_to_quantum_flat","text":"emergence-to-quantum-flat.md","leanSource":"emergence-to-quantum-flat.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:emergence-to-quantum-flat\"></a><p>For a QOU meeting the categorical volume constraint, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G_q \\cong \\mathrm{SU}_q(2)</code>. The inner-automorphism strict <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code>-group <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{INN}(G_q)</code> of John C. Baez and Aaron D. Lauda <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"baez2004\">[baez2004]</span>, corresponding to the identity crossed module <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\partial = \\mathrm{id}_{G_q}</code>, carries the vanishing fake-curvature condition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_A = B</code> of John C. Baez and Urs Schreiber <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"baez-schreiber2007\">[baez-schreiber2007, §4]</span>, reproducing the instanton equation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_A^- = 0</code> under simplicity. Quantum flatness operates as a derived consequence of the instanton axiom.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/emergence-to-quantum-flat.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.26.7","page":"b/prop-emergence-to-quantum-flat","qa":{"counts":{"pass":97,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":19,"unknown":0,"stale":94},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.emergence_to_quantum_flat","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/emergence-to-quantum-flat.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
